	TAD	TEMP2	/EMIT THE ADDR TOO
	JMS I	QOUTWRD
	JMS I	QCHECKC	/SEE IF ,
	-54
	SKP		/NO, FINISH OFF
	JMP	ONLUP	/ELSE GET NEXT LINE NUMBER
	JMS I	QOUTWRD	/NOW MARK END OF VECTOR
	JMP I	QNEWLIN	/DONE
ONSNTX,	JMS I	QERMSG	/REPORT ERROR
	ONMSG
	JMP I	QREMARK	/FLUSH STATEMENT
