	JMP I	SARCVT	/RETURN AND PROCESS NORMALLY IF END OF LIST
	TAD	SARCAS	/COMPARE TO SKELETON POINTER
	SNA
	JMP	SARARY	/IF EQUAL, ITS AN ARRAY OPCODE
	IAC		/ELSE SEE IF ITS SCALAR
	SZA CLA		/SKP IF YES
	JMP	SRCHL	/ELSE TRY AGAIN
	TAD	(SARITH-ASARITH /OUTPUT SCALAR PREFIX OPCODE
