	/GET STATEMENT

GET,	JMS	RECCOM	/DO COMMON CODE
GETLUP,	JMS I	QCHECKC	/SEE IF COMMA FOLLOWS
	-54
	JMP I	QNEWLIN	/JMP OUT IF NOTHING ELSE
	STL RAR		/SET LEFT SIDE SWITCH
	JMS I	QEXPR	/PARSE EXPRESSION
	JMP I	QREMARK	/IGNORE IT
	JMS I	QGETA1	/GET TOP OF STACK
	TAD	TYPE1	/LOOK AT TYPE BITS
	SPA CLA		/SKP IF NUMERIC EXPRESSION
	JMP	GSTRNG	/ELSE GET STRING
	JMS I	QMODSET	/SET INTERPRETER MODE TO NUMERIC
	STL RTR		/LOOK AT SUBSCRIPTED BIT
	AND	TYPE1
	SZA CLA		/SKP IF SCALAR
	JMP	DIMGET	/ELSE DO DIMENSIONED TYPE
