PUTRCL,	JMS I	QCHECKC	/SEE IF COMMA FOLLOWS
	-54
	JMP	EOREC	/END OF RECORD IF NO MORE
	JMS I	QEXPR	/GET EXPRESSION
	JMP	EOREC	/END OF REC IF NONE
